Allow me to organize the funeral for you.

118
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:23,078
I'll front the money until
you get back on your feet.

119
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:28,060
Stop with the crying already!

120
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:31,805
