I may no longer have a place to live,
but I have all the money in hand.

153
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,657
We can build from scratch.

154
00:10:11,740 --> 00:10:14,400
This is the final 500 gold coins.

155
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:15,917
You've been patient.

156
