197
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:51,100
Believe me.

198
00:12:51,460 --> 00:12:54,520
Please, Komodosaki, tell him the truth.

199
00:12:57,300 --> 00:13:00,620
I beg you, don't tell me
this was all for naught.

200
00:13:00,900 --> 00:13:03,477
The sacrifices I made,
there's nothing left.

201
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:05,820
