202
00:13:06,060 --> 00:13:07,400
It was all for you.

203
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:21,580
You're one of many, old-timer.

204
00:13:22,020 --> 00:13:23,640
We can't let you cry here.

205
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:25,137
It's bad for business.

206
00:13:25,220 --> 00:13:26,050
Time to go.

207
