Are you guys seeing this too?

222
00:14:41,020 --> 00:14:42,920
She's so beautiful!

223
00:14:43,700 --> 00:14:45,160
Whoa, her glove!

224
00:14:50,680 --> 00:14:51,510
Kuburasaki!

225
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:55,060
I sold my house and family to be with you!

226
00:14:55,300 --> 00:14:57,580
Give it back to me, you swindler!

227
00:14:57,980 --> 00:15:00,160
I trusted you!

228
00:15:02,180 --> 00:15:04,420
