246
00:16:59,040 --> 00:16:59,870
Your momo.

247
00:17:01,040 --> 00:17:02,180
Just forget it.

248
00:17:03,740 --> 00:17:05,560
Yes, I do have one.

249
00:17:06,380 --> 00:17:08,480
