252
00:17:15,080 --> 00:17:15,980
She lives!

253
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:18,237
I have faith my sister's
out there somewhere.

254
00:17:18,320 --> 00:17:20,026
I only pray that she is safe.

255
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:22,257
Well, I hope you get to meet her soon.

256
00:17:22,340 --> 00:17:23,620
I certainly don't.

257
