If her identity is known, Then
Orochi will set his sights on her.

258
00:17:29,340 --> 00:17:32,634
I cannot seek her out until
we have claimed our victory!

259
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:42,341
You were late because you were gawking at
the Oiron, and you want me to excuse that?

260
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:44,100
Guilty as charged, boss.

261
00:17:44,320 --> 00:17:46,202
